ABOUT NOVAVM
------------
NovaVM is a hardware-accelerated virtual machine manager that runs VMs
using the operating system's own built-in hypervisor — no VirtualBox,
no QEMU, no third-party software required.

Supported backends:
  - Windows Hypervisor Platform (WHP) — Windows 10 v1803+ / Windows 11
  - Linux KVM (/dev/kvm)              — Any modern Linux kernel
  - Apple Virtualization Framework    — macOS 11+

